   }
  ],
  "explain": "<p>Nothing crashes: the shapes are right and the text is fluent enough. The model is simply running on slightly wrong inputs. Comparing cached generation with full recomputation, token by token, finds the first divergence (exercise 11); run that comparison on every change to an inference engine.</p>"
